    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Pipeline",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Monolith \u2192 Microservices data pipeline\n\n`CLIENT \u2192 MONOLITH API \u2192 LEGACY POSTGRES \u2192 WAL \u2192 DEBEZIUM \u2192 KAFKA` branches into two independent consumers:\n\n`legacy.public.users \u2192 USER CDC CONSUMER \u2192 USER POSTGRES`\n\n`legacy.public.sales \u2192 SALES CDC CONSUMER \u2192 SALES POSTGRES`\n\nEvery green card below is one hop of that pipeline."
      }
    },
